    {
      "text": "%pyspark\nfrom pyspark.ml.classification import GBTClassifier\n\ngbtc \u003d GBTClassifier()\n\npg_gbtc \u003d ParamGridBuilder() \\\n    .addGrid(gbtc.maxDepth, [2, 5, 10]) \\\n    .addGrid(gbtc.maxBins, [16, 32, 64]) \\\n    .build()\n\ncv_gbtc \u003d CrossValidator(\n    estimator\u003dgbtc, \n    estimatorParamMaps\u003dpg_gbtc, \n    evaluator\u003dBinaryClassificationEvaluator(), \n    numFolds\u003d3\n)\n\ncv_gbtc_md \u003d cv_gbtc.fit(df_train)\nsave_path_cv_gbtc \u003d f\"{model_reg_path}/{dt_now_str}/GBTClassifier\"\ncv_gbtc_md.write().overwrite().save(save_path_cv_gbtc)\n\ncv_gbtc_load \u003d CrossValidatorModel.load(save_path_cv_gbtc)\ncv_gbtc_load.bestModel, max(cv_gbtc_load.avgMetrics)",
